OracleAdapter.setManualUpdateInterval

when called by the owner with a non-zero interval
    it updates the manualUpdateInterval storage value
        expect manualUpdateInterval to equal the new interval
    it emits ManualUpdateIntervalSet event
        expect the event with (interval, caller)
    it overwrites a previous non-zero value
        pre-set manualUpdateInterval to a different value; call again; expect manualUpdateInterval to equal the new interval

when called by a non-owner
    it reverts
        expect revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount including the caller
    it does not change state
        pre-set manualUpdateInterval; attempt call from non-owner; expect value unchanged

when the interval is zero
    it reverts
        expect revert with ZeroAmount error
    it does not change state
        pre-set manualUpdateInterval; call with 0; expect value unchanged
